{"title":"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/a/d6ae92aa12dd511657ee44a3c9e26daecc54d3b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2^3)^2 - 4^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"79\" height=\"21\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/1/7717870d39e6b277843d1e125c735f0060415972.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ -8 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 10 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"391\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/9/619a0016783d66957cf2d291a5fca463cf203bc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2^3)^2 - 4^3 = 8^2 - 4^3 = 64 - 64 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"321\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/f/e9f2c0a35d2339bcb85e48a627d57a9a418edeb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a^x)^y = a^{xy} = (a^y)^x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"20\" />, and use the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/9/f5975c18a4cce3b22318ffc2df02699e6594c4a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a - a = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" /> to get the answer:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/e/9eed6702d34eeec4885e0e482baf45a42b2c62a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2^3)^2 - 4^3 = (2^2)^3 - 4^3 = 4^3 - 4^3 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"340\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/2/5a2c17be56ca6b125c3330335bd186b6bd27c31d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2^3)^2 - 4^3 = 2^{3 \\times 2} - 4^3 = 2^6 - 4^3 = 64 - 64 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"418\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 11 (page does not exist)\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 13 (page does not exist)\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align